edits_description = "The text was removed, and the people were cut into a separate layer."
final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_75te4")
province = 55
blurb = "Depicts the Utsunoya Pass by the post station of Okabe (in present-day Shizuoka prefecture) on the Tōkaidō. Hiroshige published numerous prints depicting different views of the pass.

The print features the Edo period (1603-1868) path, but an alternative path through the same pass was famous since the Heian period (794–1185) under the name [i]tsuta no hosomichi[/i] (\"narrow ivy road\"), appearing in poetry and classic literature, and in 2010 being declared a National Historic Site."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
